                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5712c2cf-6beb-3c3f-982a-285636ef3e67",
                        "entry_id": "c4c79979-5521-3a1c-a61a-531e8bf2d102",
                        "glosses": [
                            "van iets of iemand dat het heel zielig is en veel medelijden en medeleven opwekt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8a330b7-0c49-4000-b462-71632fee413d",
                                "sense_id": "5712c2cf-6beb-3c3f-982a-285636ef3e67",
                                "text": "De anekdotes uit het boek hebben de Franse politiek al dagen in zijn greep. Sarkozy, schrijft Buisson, heeft geen principes, een „politiek handelaar”, „alleen geïnteresseerd in de korte termijn” en „geobsedeerd door geld”. Als president was hij badinerend over vrijwel iedere andere politicus, ook uit eigen kamp. François Fillon, vijf jaar Sarkozy’s premier, is een „zielepoot”, „deerniswekkend” en „pathetisch”. En over oud-president Chirac zegt Sarkozy in het boek: „Ik heb nog nooit zo’n corrupt figuur ontmoet.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f148767-faed-45a6-b33b-b7da53ea476d",
                                "sense_id": "5712c2cf-6beb-3c3f-982a-285636ef3e67",
                                "text": "Het jonge Zuid-Soedan bevestigt daarmee zijn status als Afrika’s meest deerniswekkende natie. Onbekwaam leiderschap, megacorruptie en een politieke machtsstrijd die ontaardde in een onverzoenlijke stammenoorlog liggen ten grondslag aan een nieuwe strijdronde. Vanochtend waren weer zware explosies en machinegeweervuur te horen in Juba. In Juba verblijven ongeveer honderd Nederlanders, hun is aangeraden het land zo snel mogelijk te verlaten. Maar voorlopig moeten ze binnen blijven, het vliegveld van Juba is gesloten."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f7c38f26-f962-4488-9437-5cb517ce00f3",
                        "source_entry_id": "c4c79979-5521-3a1c-a61a-531e8bf2d102",
                        "source_sense_id": "5712c2cf-6beb-3c3f-982a-285636ef3e67",
                        "source_sense_description": "van iets of iemand dat het heel zielig is en veel medelijden en medeleven opwekt",
                        "target_lang_word": "terrible",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "terrible",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9813bd4-1aee-30fa-9cea-538f56912a73",
                                        "entry_id": "5a9f6e30-eeb4-3475-83e2-58ea091cade0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dreadful; causing terror, alarm and fear; awesome"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e9ddfbd-936d-4f9f-97bd-8a92962cf824",
                                                "sense_id": "b9813bd4-1aee-30fa-9cea-538f56912a73",
                                                "text": "The witch laid a terrible curse on him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd5e5b80-a22e-499d-bd81-4c298afa98eb",
                                                "sense_id": "b9813bd4-1aee-30fa-9cea-538f56912a73",
                                                "text": "People who have not been in Narnia sometimes think that a thing cannot be good and terrible at the same time. If the children had ever thought so, they were cured of it now. For when they tried to look at Aslan's face they just caught a glimpse of the golden mane and the great, royal, solemn, overwhelming eyes; and then they found they couldn't look at him and went all trembly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf27e04d-891d-32b2-b137-bab7ac256abd",
                                        "entry_id": "5a9f6e30-eeb4-3475-83e2-58ea091cade0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Formidable, powerful."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b2b55f5-8bd3-4fa0-9da9-d0eebd9f4a50",
                                                "sense_id": "bf27e04d-891d-32b2-b137-bab7ac256abd",
                                                "text": "[…]and there was even a party of the younger men who pretended to admire him, calling him a \"true sea-dog,\" and \"real old salt,\" and such-like names, and saying there was the sort of man that made England terrible at sea."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17834657-fa09-480c-8be9-cab9a617a723",
                                                "sense_id": "bf27e04d-891d-32b2-b137-bab7ac256abd",
                                                "text": "\"He is the right sort of man for a labourer, but he is a terrible eater, to be sure,\" thought the farmer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2baff8e4-0a8a-371a-86d8-647d58b4daa8",
                                        "entry_id": "5a9f6e30-eeb4-3475-83e2-58ea091cade0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Intense; extreme in degree or extent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff55d821-50f8-42b4-bc6a-699e3492d0b2",
                                                "sense_id": "2baff8e4-0a8a-371a-86d8-647d58b4daa8",
                                                "text": "He paid a terrible price for his life of drinking."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a4d8fb1-3d7b-4c0b-9cc7-d9bcdb581aa6",
                                                "sense_id": "2baff8e4-0a8a-371a-86d8-647d58b4daa8",
                                                "text": "‘Then the father has a great fight with his terrible conscience,’ said Munday with granite seriousness. ‘Should he make a row with the police […]? Or should he say nothing about it and condone brutality for fear of appearing in the newspapers?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8e20683c-cbd8-37c1-8f7a-15fbd8f9ed4d",
                                        "entry_id": "5a9f6e30-eeb4-3475-83e2-58ea091cade0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unpleasant; disagreeable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6248057e-f052-4491-98da-8c5efeb0d1be",
                                                "sense_id": "8e20683c-cbd8-37c1-8f7a-15fbd8f9ed4d",
                                                "text": "The food was terrible, but it was free."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "080f9aec-06ba-4372-804d-0f3816816cfb",
                                                "sense_id": "8e20683c-cbd8-37c1-8f7a-15fbd8f9ed4d",
                                                "text": "To Edward […] he was terrible, nerve-inflaming, poisonously asphyxiating. He sat rocking himself in the late Mr. Churchill's swing chair, smoking and twaddling."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a5810f2-1ab0-3380-9e70-c6d2bd3199ae",
                                        "entry_id": "5a9f6e30-eeb4-3475-83e2-58ea091cade0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very bad; lousy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09d3b65c-f6b3-44f7-b56a-fe104be72849",
                                                "sense_id": "6a5810f2-1ab0-3380-9e70-c6d2bd3199ae",
                                                "text": "Whatever he thinks, he is a terrible driver."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e99991c-0d09-4f7b-b731-48ac8ef07222",
                                                "sense_id": "6a5810f2-1ab0-3380-9e70-c6d2bd3199ae",
                                                "text": "The openly ridiculous plot has The Pirate Captain (Hugh Grant) scheming to win the Pirate Of The Year competition, even though he’s a terrible pirate, far outclassed by rivals voiced by Jeremy Piven and Salma Hayek."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "terrible",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c9852e29-d53a-376e-82ca-78abb0e20d42",
                                        "entry_id": "fd9960b8-cf1b-33b4-839f-646da80d5f2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a terrible way; to a terrible extent; terribly; awfully."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "dialectal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25c1de11-fdab-49e6-aab6-e8a56592cb5b",
                                                "sense_id": "c9852e29-d53a-376e-82ca-78abb0e20d42",
                                                "text": "‘Oh, terrible bad, sir, terrible deep the snow is,’ said the hedgehog."
                                            }
                                        ]
